The three creates must run as ordered subrequests in one Composite call with `allOrNone` so a trigger failure rolls back the Account and Asset as well. Asset is inserted before `Service_Request__c` so the before-insert lookup by serial number can see it, and collation is disabled so that implicit dependency is not reordered.

